(O110 - Auto Tool Change with Probe)
(Complete automated tool change cycle:)
(1. Move to tool setter location)
(2. Probe tool length)
(3. Store offset in tool table)
(4. Return to work and continue)
(Call as: O110 call [tool_number])
(Requires: [TOOL_SETTER] X, Y, VEL, REF_Z, MAX_PROBE_DEPTH in INI)
(Requires: [PROBE] Z_SAFE in INI for safe retract height)

O110 sub

    #<tool_num> = #1
    #<setter_x> = #<_ini[TOOL_SETTER]X>
    #<setter_y> = #<_ini[TOOL_SETTER]Y>
    #<setter_vel> = #<_ini[TOOL_SETTER]VEL>
    #<setter_ref_z> = #<_ini[TOOL_SETTER]REF_Z>
    #<max_depth> = #<_ini[TOOL_SETTER]MAX_PROBE_DEPTH>
    #<z_safe> = #<_ini[PROBE]Z_SAFE>

    (Safety: stop spindle and coolant)
    M5
    M9

    (Save current position to return later)
    #<saved_x> = #5420
    #<saved_y> = #5421
    #<saved_z> = #5422

    (Move to safe Z height)
    G90
    G53 G0 Z#<z_safe>

    (Move to tool setter XY)
    G53 G0 X#<setter_x> Y#<setter_y>

    (Fast probe down)
    G91
    G38.2 Z[0 - #<max_depth>] F[#<setter_vel> * 4]
    G0 Z2.0

    (Slow probe for accuracy)
    G38.2 Z-4.0 F#<setter_vel>

    (Calculate tool length relative to setter reference)
    #<tool_length> = [#5063 - #<setter_ref_z>]

    (Store in tool table)
    G10 L1 P#<tool_num> Z#<tool_length>

    (Activate the new offset)
    G43 H#<tool_num>

    (Return to saved position)
    G90
    G53 G0 Z#<z_safe>
    G0 X#<saved_x> Y#<saved_y>
    G0 Z#<saved_z>

    (MSG, Tool #<tool_num> probed. Length: #<tool_length>)

O110 endsub
M2
